                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "245d76d1-bbd4-32a9-8070-fb1e3e6e2bfa",
                        "entry_id": "1152d406-b123-3b2f-b638-ca52c8b6a247",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A horse that competes in races."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "99eaf5f9-5fa5-4f87-9c9b-445aa099c621",
                                "sense_id": "245d76d1-bbd4-32a9-8070-fb1e3e6e2bfa",
                                "text": "They were bosker horses. Until I went to work for Bill I didn't know how good racehorses are."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "75f065f7-debc-4e0a-8bd2-c16f6a07ad09",
                                "sense_id": "245d76d1-bbd4-32a9-8070-fb1e3e6e2bfa",
                                "text": "Long before you see the lean, handsome heads peering mildly over the half-doors of the loose boxes, you know that East Ilsley's business is training racehorses."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c440f79e-9f04-4179-a30f-ccdeaf953142",
                                "sense_id": "245d76d1-bbd4-32a9-8070-fb1e3e6e2bfa",
                                "text": "Picture yourself betting on a racehorse, seeing the animal take the lead, and then watching the horse suddenly stop because it pulled a muscle not properly warmed up by its trainers. You’d get pretty heated under the collar, and that’s not the kind of warm-up that’s very beneficial. Horseflesh and humanflesh alike need to be warmed up before strenuous activity."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "97a7e42e-41f6-4ef3-a2a6-08e59ed4d7eb",
                                "sense_id": "245d76d1-bbd4-32a9-8070-fb1e3e6e2bfa",
                                "text": "Clearly, it’s that Secretariat is overrated. OK, exhale. I’m not trolling you. I’m just being extremely nitty about the marginal shades of “really, really great.” By “overrated,” I certainly don’t mean to imply that Secretariat isn’t the best 3-year-old American racehorse in history – he is."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
